                        ],
                        "form": "die Handschellen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                        "entry_id": "42fdd3a4-1c82-323c-9649-c0bdbef60201",
                        "glosses": [
                            "stählerne, verschließbare Fessel um die Handgelenke"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural-normally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5cdcabf-64d6-4b30-b320-e072d26c5775",
                                "sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                                "text": "Der Polizist legte dem Dieb Handschellen an."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1308166c-459f-4ba0-ad64-f5dd4e816cb0",
                                "sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                                "text": "„Ich bin verhaftet, die Herren legen mir Handschellen an, ich werde zuerst aufs Revier geführt, dann in die Artilleriekaserne und in einen Holzverschlag der Wachtstube gesperrt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f470f6d6-3b8c-4fa1-b6ca-915b5640cb4a",
                                "sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                                "text": "„Man legte mir Handschellen an und eskortierte mich hinaus.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "597d3f93-ddb9-4711-a981-754c804023fa",
                                "sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                                "text": "„Sie behielten die Handschellen mit den Stricken auch noch um, als der Polizist sie über den Hof zog.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2b4d6b6-dbe7-438a-8dd4-678d014bd132",
                                "sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                                "text": "„Er legte die Arme auf den Rücken und spürte, wie die Handschellen sich um seine Handgelenke schlossen, dann führten ihn die Polizeibeamten zur Friedhofspforte.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a24e3b8-7db7-4714-bf76-5d037949cb81",
                        "source_entry_id": "42fdd3a4-1c82-323c-9649-c0bdbef60201",
                        "source_sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                        "source_sense_description": "meist Plural: stählerne, verschließbare Fessel um die Handgelenke",
                        "target_lang_word": "handcuff",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "handcuff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c019ba58-9761-31e7-b48a-772535799e24",
                                        "entry_id": "ecebceed-7fe1-3af5-850b-9f8cab3fdbc6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One ring of a locking fetter for the hand or one pair."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare",
                                            "singular"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "handcuff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f687adc5-a8c8-3b52-86bf-8c71ef0f358c",
                                        "entry_id": "bfb724fa-341f-3747-b619-4978a82560fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To apply handcuffs to someone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60984137-e6b5-49cf-b474-58df0fd6af80",
                                                "sense_id": "f687adc5-a8c8-3b52-86bf-8c71ef0f358c",
                                                "text": "The sheriff had brought along all the handcuffs necessary, and in a few seconds he had handcuffed Koswell. He threw a pair of the steel bracelets to Dick and another pair to Tom, and the Rovers had the satisfaction of handcuffing Josiah Crabtree and Tad Sobber. Then the sheriff made prisoners of the rest of the crowd[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c0442f9-0f36-4c9b-87d1-844f3313018e",
                                                "sense_id": "f687adc5-a8c8-3b52-86bf-8c71ef0f358c",
                                                "text": "The sheriff’s office released a compilation of bodycam footage Friday from deputies at the scene that shows them handcuffing Earl and pinning him down for more than 20 minutes as he struggles and repeatedly shouts for help."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8705097e-48cb-45e4-8cea-bfc63786916c",
                                                "sense_id": "f687adc5-a8c8-3b52-86bf-8c71ef0f358c",
                                                "text": "Conservative influencer Nick Sortor is handcuffed Thursday night by a police officer outside an ICE facility in Portland, Oregon, a bystander video shows; the video does not show events leading up to the arrest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82a220e2-d27c-3f40-884c-034d29aea656",
                                        "entry_id": "bfb724fa-341f-3747-b619-4978a82560fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "to restrain or restrict."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b1a7e19-7df6-4e9d-8913-cbdf48542ea4",
                                                "sense_id": "82a220e2-d27c-3f40-884c-034d29aea656",
                                                "text": "Dang, I’m handcuffed by these regulations. I’d like to help but it’d be illegal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb3c3c93-6263-4e5b-a390-105537a3df5c",
                                                "sense_id": "82a220e2-d27c-3f40-884c-034d29aea656",
                                                "text": "After all, since our marriage has proved a childless one, the only reason for our submitting to be handcuffed to one another, now that our hearts are no longer in the arrangement, is gone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0a3dd97-d020-4471-83dc-ada8986d7b17",
                                                "sense_id": "82a220e2-d27c-3f40-884c-034d29aea656",
                                                "text": "If he were a king, as his swagger and opera-singing occasionally suggested, he would stretch the constitution any way he wanted. In fact, as he admitted with a grin, it handcuffed him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db497a9d-12a0-44f1-9fad-cd31473e46ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "42fdd3a4-1c82-323c-9649-c0bdbef60201",
                        "source_sense_id": "35292b9b-2a28-3cf3-a6a9-e7871d53e5f8",
                        "source_sense_description": "meist Plural: stählerne, verschließbare Fessel um die Handgelenke",
                        "target_lang_word": "menottes",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "menottes",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba7342da-284a-3cdc-8c9c-84d6c4d8d25b",
                                        "entry_id": "6ddc95fd-6e5a-3465-ad5b-e9e41f3dfe88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lien de fer ou de corde qu’on met aux poignets d’une personne, pour lui ôter l’usage des mains."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "769b4b59-b9b3-407d-9d00-78a39ac09112",
                                                "sense_id": "ba7342da-284a-3cdc-8c9c-84d6c4d8d25b",
                                                "text": "Maintenant qu’il était libre, qu’il disposait de ses bras et de ses jambes, qu’il pouvait, à son gré, travailler, se reposer, dormir, délivré des menottes de son ancienne condition, maintenant, il prenait sa revanche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81329bca-343a-4b0e-a8c0-d630abe2fe09",
                                                "sense_id": "ba7342da-284a-3cdc-8c9c-84d6c4d8d25b",
                                                "text": "Nu-pieds, dans la cellule humide, l’enfant, les huit premiers jours, a les bras liés derrière le dos. Des menottes lui serrent les poignets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac8e7d02-6b05-4b4d-beb7-e7318e03c313",
                                                "sense_id": "ba7342da-284a-3cdc-8c9c-84d6c4d8d25b",
                                                "text": "Marcas s'arrêta devant un présentoir rempli d'accessoires SM et prit une paire de menottes, finement cloutées à l'intérieur. Il secoua la tête en souriant.\n— Ce n'est pas le modèle homologué par la police nationale, chère madame."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
